  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blue Bond Accelerator - Advancing Global South Blue Bonds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ORRAA&#x2019;s Blue Bond Accelerator (BBA) is a specialist not-for-profit focused on stimulating and growing long-term capital flows into the Regenerative and Sustainable Blue Economy (RSBE) from bond markets that deliver benefits to marginalised communities by reducing poverty, build coastal resilience, and stabilise climate through the protection of vulnerable ecosystems, particularly in low- and middle-income countries and Small Island Developing States (SIDS). The BBA aims to catalyse a high-quality USD$50 &#x2013; 100 billion blue bond market by 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
